      "text": "Diagramme de classes UML « Harness schemas — attributes derived from JSON Schema », en quatre paquetages. test : KG QA Report (kg-qa/v1 ; subject kind process|decision|role|requirement|skill|graph|tool, criteria, totals, pair_attestations) et Test Run (folio-test-run/v1 ; skill, subject, data and process hashes, outcome, cases). process : Task (process, task ; BPMN callActivity, serviceTask, task et userTask) « in process » Process (OMG BPMN 2.0 externe ; start and end events, gateways, lanes, sequence flows) — noté comme XSD et non JSON Schema. scenario : Actor (id, title, kind person|agent|system|external, roles) « takes on roles » Role (persona, actorKinds, skills, inherits, actedUpon, judgementOnly) ; User Story (role, want, soThat) « as a role » ; Role « carries skills » Skill (id, name, description, roles, requiredCapabilities, dependsOn, allowedTools, routingPatterns, tags, package, lifecycleStages plan|author|validate|review|test|publish|feedback|retire). schema : JSON Schema (draft-07, issu de Zod) et External Schema (authority OMG|DCMI|W3C|IETF|ISO|HL7|other ; use conforms|reads|cites). Relations : KG QA Report audite subject kind ; Test Run teste Skill ; Task dans le couloir de Role et utilise Skill ; chaque classe est conforme à JSON Schema.",
