      "text": "Diagrama de clases UML «Harness schemas — attributes derived from JSON Schema», en cuatro paquetes. test: KG QA Report (kg-qa/v1; subject kind process|decision|role|requirement|skill|graph|tool, criteria, totals, pair_attestations) y Test Run (folio-test-run/v1; skill, subject, data and process hashes, outcome, cases). process: Task (process, task; BPMN callActivity, serviceTask, task y userTask) «in process» Process (OMG BPMN 2.0 externo; start and end events, gateways, lanes, sequence flows) — anotado como XSD, no JSON Schema. scenario: Actor (id, title, kind person|agent|system|external, roles) «takes on roles» Role (persona, actorKinds, skills, inherits, actedUpon, judgementOnly); User Story (role, want, soThat) «as a role»; Role «carries skills» Skill (id, name, description, roles, requiredCapabilities, dependsOn, allowedTools, routingPatterns, tags, package, lifecycleStages plan|author|validate|review|test|publish|feedback|retire). schema: JSON Schema (draft-07, derivado de Zod) y External Schema (authority OMG|DCMI|W3C|IETF|ISO|HL7|other; use conforms|reads|cites). Aristas: KG QA Report audita subject kind; Test Run prueba Skill; Task en el carril de Role y usa Skill; cada clase se ajusta a JSON Schema.",
